---

<Layout
	title="Corsi Fitness — Ronchiverdi Sport Club"
	description="Il palinsesto Corsi Fitness di Ronchiverdi: mobilità, pilates, yoga, tonificazione, funzionale e danza. Corsi di gruppo per ogni livello, tutta la settimana."
>
	<PageHero image="images/activities/fitness.jpg" imageAlt="Corso fitness di gruppo al Ronchiverdi Sport Club" eyebrow="Attività sportive">
		<Fragment slot="title">Corsi Fitness, <em class="accent">allenati in gruppo</em></Fragment>
		<Fragment slot="lede">Un palinsesto ricco tutta la settimana: mobilità, pilates, yoga, tonificazione, funzionale e danza, per allenare corpo e mente con la spinta del gruppo.</Fragment>
	</PageHero>

	<IconFacts eyebrow="Come funziona" title="Tutto quello che ti serve sapere" items={facts} />

	<section class="courses-section">
		<div class="courses-section__head">
			<span class="eyebrow">Il palinsesto</span>
			<h2>I nostri corsi</h2>
			<p class="lede" style="margin-inline:auto">
				Diciotto format diversi per allenare mobilità, forza, resistenza e divertimento. Clicca su una lezione nel planning qui sotto per leggerne la descrizione completa.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="course-grid">
			{courses.map((c) => (
				<article class="course-card">
					<span class="course-card__icon" aria-hidden="true" set:html={c.icon} />
					<div class="course-card__head">
						<h3>{c.name}</h3>
						<span class="course-card__categoria">{c.categoria}</span>
					</div>
					<p>{c.description}</p>
				</article>
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="planning-section">
		<div class="planning-section__head">
			<span class="eyebrow">Planning settimanale</span>
			<h2>Il palinsesto Corsi Fitness</h2>
			<p class="lede" style="margin-inline:0">
				Orari dei corsi in sala e nell'area funzionale Lacertosus. Clicca su una lezione per leggerne la descrizione.
			</p>
		</div>
		<WeeklySchedule id="corsi-fitness" lessons={corsiFitnessLessons} schedule={corsiFitnessSchedule} />
		<div class="planning-section__cta">
			<a class="btn" href={url("/planning")}>Consulta il planning completo</a>
		</div>
		<div class="section-cta">
			<button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-open-contact data-interest="club-adulti">Contattaci</button>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Faq items={faq} />

	<section class="final-cta">
		<h2>Vieni a scoprire il club</h2>
		<p class="lede" style="margin-inline:auto">
			Prenota un <strong>tour gratuito</strong> e scopri i corsi dal vivo.
		</p>
		<div class="final-cta__buttons">
			<button type="button" class="btn" data-open-contact data-interest="club-adulti">Prenota un tour</button>
			<button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-open-contact data-interest="club-adulti">Contattaci</button>
		</div>
	</section>

	<style>
		.courses-section {
			max-width: 84rem;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 1rem 1.5rem 4rem;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
			padding-top: 3rem;
		}
		.courses-section__head {
			text-align: center;
			max-width: 42rem;
			margin: 0 auto;
		}
		.course-grid {
			margin-top: 2.5rem;
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
		.course-card {
			border: 1px solid var(--border);
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: var(--bg-alt);
			padding: 1.75rem 1.6rem 1.9rem;
			transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), border-color 0.3s ease;
		}
		.course-card:hover {
			transform: translateY(-4px);
			border-color: var(--accent);
			box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -12px rgba(28, 28, 24, 0.25);
		}
		.course-card__icon {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			width: 3rem;
			height: 3rem;
			margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
			border-radius: 50%;
			background: var(--accent-tint);
			color: var(--accent);
			transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
		}
		.course-card:hover .course-card__icon {
			background: var(--accent);
			color: var(--text-on-dark);
			transform: scale(1.08);
		}
		.course-card__head {
			display: flex;
			align-items: baseline;
			justify-content: space-between;
			gap: 0.75rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
		}
		.course-card__head h3 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
		.course-card__categoria {
			flex-shrink: 0;
			padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
			border-radius: 999px;
			background: var(--bg);
			border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
			font-family: var(--font-sans);
			font-size: var(--text-2xs);
			font-weight: 600;
			letter-spacing: 0.03em;
			color: var(--accent);
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
		.course-card p {
			margin: 0;
			font-family: var(--font-sans);
			font-size: var(--text-sm);
			color: var(--text-muted);
			line-height: 1.6;
		}
		@media (max-width: 960px) {
			.course-grid {
				grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			}
		}
		@media (max-width: 640px) {
			.course-grid {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}
		}

		.planning-section {
			max-width: 88rem;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 1rem 1.5rem 5rem;
		}
		.planning-section__head {
			text-align: center;
			max-width: 42rem;
			margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
		}
		.planning-section__head .lede {
			margin-top: 0.5rem;
		}
		.planning-section__cta {
			text-align: center;
			margin-top: 2.5rem;
		}
		.section-cta {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.final-cta {
			padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
			text-align: center;
			background: var(--bg-alt);
		}
		.final-cta .lede {
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}
		.final-cta__buttons {
			display: flex;
			gap: 1rem;
			justify-content: center;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
		}
		.btn-outline {
			cursor: pointer;
			font-family: var(--font-sans);
			border: 1px solid currentColor;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
